    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Professional Summary</div>
    <p class="summary-text">
      Motivated B.Tech Artificial Intelligence &amp; Data Science student with a strong foundation in Python, Java, Machine Learning, and Computer Vision. Experienced in developing AI-powered real-world applications, including a face-recognition-based Smart Attendance System built with OpenCV and MySQL. Passionate about leveraging AI and software development to solve complex problems innovatively. Seeking internship opportunities where I can apply my skills, collaborate with cross-functional teams, and contribute to impactful technology solutions across AI, software engineering, and data-driven domains.
    </p>
  </div>

