      <div class="skill-group">
        <div class="skill-group-label">Developer Tools</div>
        <div class="skill-tags">Git &nbsp;·&nbsp; GitHub &nbsp;·&nbsp; Visual Studio Code</div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-group">
        <div class="skill-group-label">Core CS Subjects</div>
        <div class="skill-tags">OOP &nbsp;·&nbsp; DBMS &nbsp;·&nbsp; Data Structures &amp; Algorithms (Learning) &nbsp;·&nbsp; Problem Solving</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- INTERNSHIP -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Internship</div>
    <div class="entry">
      <div class="entry-header">
        <div>
          <span class="entry-title">Web Development Intern</span>
          <span class="entry-subtitle"> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Brainery Spot Technology</span>
        </div>
        <div class="entry-date">Internship Program</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="bullets">
        <li>Participated in a structured web development internship, gaining hands-on exposure to modern development workflows and best practices.</li>
        <li>Collaborated with a development team on project-based tasks involving front-end implementation, debugging, and code review processes.</li>
        <li>Developed practical skills in software collaboration, iterative problem-solving, and delivering solutions under professional guidance.</li>
        <li>Enhanced understanding of software development lifecycle (SDLC) and project documentation within an industry setting.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PROJECTS -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Projects</div>
    <div class="entry">
      <div class="entry-header">
        <span class="entry-title">Smart Attendance System using Face Recognition</span>
