      <div class="entry-meta">Python &nbsp;·&nbsp; OpenCV &nbsp;·&nbsp; Face Recognition Library &nbsp;·&nbsp; MySQL &nbsp;·&nbsp; Git &nbsp;·&nbsp; GitHub</div>
