        <li>Architected and developed an AI-powered attendance management system that automatically identifies registered students using facial recognition technology, eliminating manual attendance processes.</li>
        <li>Implemented real-time face detection and recognition pipeline using OpenCV and the face_recognition library, applying core Computer Vision concepts to achieve accurate identification.</li>
        <li>Designed and integrated a structured MySQL database schema for secure and efficient storage of student profiles, registration data, and timestamped attendance records.</li>
        <li>Built a complete student registration module enabling seamless onboarding of new users with image capture and database entry.</li>
        <li>Reduced manual attendance errors and improved tracking accuracy by automating the identification workflow using Python-based AI logic.</li>
